                                <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">GPU-Accelerated Heat Equation Solver</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
                                    Implemented OpenCL kernels for solving the heat equation on 2D grids, demonstrating mastery of GPU programming concepts including memory management and kernel optimization.
                                </p>
                                <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-code text-indigo-400 mr-2"></i>184 lines of C + OpenCL kernels</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-cube text-indigo-400 mr-2"></i>2D grid-based numerical computation</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-memory text-indigo-400 mr-2"></i>Optimized GPU memory transfers</li>
                                    <li><i class="fas fa-rocket text-indigo-400 mr-2"></i>Massively parallel kernel execution</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">OpenCL Architecture</h4>
                                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-sm">
                                    <div class="text-indigo-400 mb-2">Implementation Features:</div>
                                    <div class="text-gray-300 space-y-1">
                                        <div>• Host-device memory management</div>
                                        <div>• 2D work-group optimization</div>
                                        <div>• Boundary condition handling</div>
                                        <div>• Grid-based heat diffusion</div>
                                        <div>• Cross-platform GPU support</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

